      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairfield%2C_Utah"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Originally known as Frogtown, the town was renamed Fairfield in 1861 to honor pioneer Amos Fielding.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
