      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairfield%2C_Utah"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Camp Floyd once made Fairfield the third largest town in the state with over seven thousand occupants.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
